{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"凛世、お疲れ\r\n──よく頑張った","trans":"凛世，辛苦了\n──你做得很好","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6012003030020","name":"凛世","text":"────\r\nプロデューサーさま…………","trans":"────\n制作人…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-5","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……謝る必要なんかないよ\r\nこんな時だってある。ステージの上の世界にはさ","trans":"……没必要道歉\n这种事总会有的。在舞台上的世界里嘛","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6012003030040","name":"凛世","text":"…………\r\nでしたら……なお…………","trans":"…………\n既然如此……就更……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6012003030050","name":"凛世","text":"皆さまの……お心に……\r\n届かず……","trans":"大家……的心里……\n没能传到……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6012003030060","name":"凛世","text":"申し訳……────","trans":"非常……抱歉……────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-14","name":"プロデューサー","text":"り、凛世……っ！","trans":"凛、凛世……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-15","name":"プロデューサー","text":"…………\r\nなんで……そんなこと────","trans":"…………\n为什么……要说那种话────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}